  "questions": [
    {
      "dom_id": "question-335653",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=x(t)+y(t)+1 \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)={x}^{3}(t)+y(t)+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following gives all equilibrium points of the system of differential equations above?",
      "worked_solution": "The equilibrium (fixed) points of a system ${x}^{′}(t)=f(x,y)$ are the points for which $f(x,y)=0.$ So, we get the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x+y+1=0 \\\\ {x}^{3}+y+1=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we solve the first equation for $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+y+1=0\\,⇒\\,y=-x-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute $y$ into the second equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{3}+y+1 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{3}+(-x-1)+1 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{3}-x & =0 \\\\ x({x}^{2}-1) & =0 \\\\ x(x-1)(x+1) & =0 \\\\ x & =-1,\\text{ }0,\\text{ }1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute $y:$\n\n- For $x=0,$ we get $y=-0-1=-1.$\n\n- For $x=1,$ we get $y=-1-1=-2.$\n\n- For $x=-1,$ we get $y=-(-1)-1=0.$\n\nTherefore, the equilibrium points are\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}],\\,\\text{and}\\,[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "problem_field_keys": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": "Correct",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"question-335653\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">1.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"335653\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"9\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7B TEX-S4\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 9.961em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-bottom: 0.35em;\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-var\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2032\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-