      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-335461\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">4.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"335461\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Select the correct options in the statement below that describe a <strong>stable</strong> equilibrium point.</p>\n</div><div class=\"questionBody\" id=\"questionBody-335461\">The solutions that start \n<div class=\"selectList\" id=\"selectList-335461-0\" style=\"margin: 1px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame incorrectSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-335461-0\" style=\"width: 161px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">exactly at</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">sufficiently close to</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">sufficiently away from</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">exactly at</div></div></div>\nthe equilibrium\n<div class=\"selectList\" id=\"selectList-335461-1\" style=\"margin: 1px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-335461-1\" style=\"width: 224px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">remain close to</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">remain close to</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">eventually move away from</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">approach and move away from</div></div></div>\nit for all future time, and\n<div class=\"selectList\" id=\"selectList-335461-2\" style=\"margin: 1px 1px 1px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-335461-2\" style=\"width: 332px; height: 21px; line-height: 21px;\">may not converge to the equilibrium as <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%