      "html": "<div id=\"question-332966\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">7.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"332966\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Select the correct options in the statement below that describe a <strong>stable</strong> equilibrium point.</p>\n</div><div id=\"questionBody-332966\" class=\"questionBody\">The solutions that start sufficiently \n<div id=\"selectList-332966-0\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-332966-0\" style=\"width: 87px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">close to</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">close to</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">away from</div></div></div>\nthe equilibrium remain close to the equilibrium\n<div id=\"selectList-332966-1\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-332966-1\" style=\"width: 179px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">but may not converge to</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">but may not converge to</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">and converge to</div></div></div> \nthe \n<div id=\"selectList-332966-2\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-332966-2\" style=\"width: 91px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">equilibrium</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">equilibrium</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">infinity</div></div></div> \nas \n<div id=\"selectList-332966-3\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 2px 2px 4px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-332966-3\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 22px; line-height: 22px;\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"5\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2192\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo accent=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 22px;\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"5\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2192\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo accent=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 22px;\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"6\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"