      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-332966\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">7.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"332966\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Select the correct options in the statement below that describe a <strong>stable</strong> equilibrium point.</p>\n</div><div class=\"questionBody\" id=\"questionBody-332966\">The solutions that start sufficiently \n<div class=\"selectList\" id=\"selectList-332966-0\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-332966-0\" style=\"width: 87px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">close to</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">close to</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">away from</div></div></div>\nthe equilibrium remain close to the equilibrium\n<div class=\"selectList\" id=\"selectList-332966-1\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-332966-1\" style=\"width: 179px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">but may not converge to</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">but may not converge to</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">and converge to</div></div></div> \nthe \n<div class=\"selectList\" id=\"selectList-332966-2\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-332966-2\" style=\"width: 91px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">equilibrium</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">equilibrium</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">infinity</div></div></div> \nas \n<div class=\"selectList\" id=\"selectList-332966-3\" style=