  "canonical_examples": [
    {
      "dom_id": "step-588702",
      "name": "Example: \n                    Finding Equilibrium Points of a System",
      "problem": "$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=x(t)-2y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)={y}^{2}(t)-x(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFind all equilibrium points of the system of differential equations above.",
      "worked_solution": "The equilibrium (fixed) points of a system $\\mathbf{x}'(t) = \\mathbf{f}(x,y)$ are the points for which $\\mathbf{f}(x,y)=\\mathbf{0}.$ So, we get the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=0 \\\\ {y}^{2}-x=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we solve the first equation for $y{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x-2y=0\\,⇒\\,y=\\frac{x}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute $y$ into the second equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{2}-x & =0 \\\\ {(\\frac{x}{2})}^{2}-x & =0 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}-x & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-4x & =0 \\\\ x(x-4) & =0 \\\\ x & =0,\\text{ }4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute $y{:}$\n\n- For $x=0,$ we get $y = \\dfrac{0}{2} = 0.$\n\n- For $x=4,$ we get $y = \\dfrac{4}{2} = 2.$\n\nTherefore, the equilibrium points are\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14120884/assets/82b6d431638e3abb1c1aebf818f3fbe9f2eb92c7232a3b83c93dc6cb4e563c91.svg)",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "problem_field_keys": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": null,
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"step-588702\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"588702\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"21665\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-588702\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">Finding Equilibrium Points of a System</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"588702\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                    