T158 404H154Q131 404 112 385T82 344T65 302T57 280Q55 278 41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAINB-78\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2032\" x=\"859\" y=\"583\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"902\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-74\" x=\"1291\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"1653\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"2320\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAINB-66\" x=\"3376\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"3830\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"4219\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"4792\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-79\" x=\"5237\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"5735\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"6124\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>\nHowever, just knowing where equilibrium points are is not enough: we\nalso want to understand <em>how nearby solutions behave</em> when we start\nclose to an equilibrium point.</p>\n<p>Roughly speaking, there are three qualitatively different behaviors.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>An equilibrium point <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.465ex\" height=\"2.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.255ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -755.5 1061.4 865.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\\mathbf{x}^\\ast</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAINB-78\" d=\"M227 0Q212 3 121 3Q40 3 28 0H21V62H117L245 213L109 382H26V444H34Q49 441 143 441Q247 441 265 444H274V382H246L281 339Q315 297 316 297Q320 297 354 341L389 382H352V444H360Q375 441 466 441Q547 441 559 444H566V382H471L355 246L504 63L545 62H586V0H578Q563 3 469 3Q365 3 347 0H338V62H366Q366 63 326 112T285 163L198 63L217 62H235V0H227Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2217\" d=\"M229 286Q216 420 216 436Q216 454 240 464Q241 464 245 464T251 465Q263 464 273 456T283 436Q283 419 277 356T270 286L328 328Q384 369 389 372T399 375Q412 375 423 365T435 338Q435 325 425 315Q420 312 357 282T289 250L355 219L425 184Q434 175 434 161Q434 146 425 136T401 125Q393 125 383 131T328 171L270 213Q283 79 283 63Q283 53 276 44T250 35Q231 35 224 44T216 63Q216 80 222 143T229 213L171 171Q115 130 110 127Q106 124 100 124Q87 124 76 134T64 161Q64 166 64 169T67 175T72 181T81 188T94 195T113 204T138 215T170 230T210 250L74 315Q65 324 65 338Q65 353 74 363T98 374Q106 374 116 368T171 328L229 286Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAINB-78\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2217\" x=\"859\" y=\"513\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is called <strong>stable</strong> if for\nany neighborhood <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.773ex\" height=\"2.134ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.255ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -809.3 763.5 918.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">O</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMATHI-4F\" d=\"M740 435Q740 320 676 213T511 42T304 -22Q207 -22 138 35T51 201Q50 209 50 244Q50 346 98 438T227 601Q351 704 476 704Q514 704 524 703Q621 689 680 617T740 435ZM637 476Q637 565 591 615T476 665Q396 665 322 605Q242 542 200 428T157 216Q157 126 200 73T314 19Q404 19 485 98T608 313Q637 408 637 476Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-4F\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.465ex\" height=\"2.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.255ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -755.5 1061.4 865.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\\mathbf{x}^\\ast</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAINB-78\" d=\"M227 0Q212 3 121 3Q40 3 28 0H21V62H117L245 213L109 382H26V444H34Q49 441 143 441Q247 441 265 444H274V382H246L281 339Q315 297 316 297Q320 297 354 341L389 382H352V444H360Q375 441 466 441Q547 441 559 444H566V382H471L355 246L504 63L545 62H586V0H578Q563 3 469 3Q365 3 347 0H338V62H366Q366 63 326 112T285 163L198 63L217 62H235V0H227Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-2217\" d=\"M229 286Q216 420 216 436Q216 454 240 464Q241 464 245 464T251 465Q263 464 273 456T283 436Q283 419 277 356T270 286L328 328Q384 369 389 372T399 375Q412 375 423 365T435 338Q435 325 425 315Q420 312 357 282T289 250L355 219L425 184Q434 175 434 161Q434 146 425 136T401 125Q393 125 383 131T328 171L270 213Q283 79 283 63Q283 53 276 44T250 35Q231 35 224 44T216 63Q216 80 222 143T229 213L171 171Q115 130 110 127Q106 124 100 124Q87 124 76 134T64 161Q64 166 64 169T67 175T72 181T81 188T94 195T113 204T138 215T170 230T210 250L74 315Q65 324 65 338Q65 353 74 363T98 374Q106 374 116 368T171 328L229 286Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAINB-78\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-2217\" x=\"859\" y=\"513\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> there exists a neighborhood\n<span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"7.699ex\" height=\"2.384ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.505ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -809.3 3315 1026.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">O_1 \\subseteq O</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMATHI-4F\" d=\"M740 435Q740 320 676 213T511 42T304 -22Q207 -22 138 35T51 201Q50 209 50 244Q50 346 98 438T227 601Q351 704 476 704Q514 704 524 703Q621 689 680 617T740 435ZM637 476Q637 565 591 615T476 665Q396 665 322 605Q242 542 200 428T157 216Q157 126 200 73T314 19Q404 19 485 98T608 313Q637 408 637 476Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-2286\" d=\"M84 346Q84 468 166 546T360 635Q361 635 370 635T395 635T430 636T475 636T524 636H679Q694 628 694 616Q694 607 681 597L522 596H470H441Q366 596 338 592T266 568Q244 557 224 542T179 500T139 433T124 346V341Q124 253 185 185Q244 121 328 103Q348 98 366 98T522 96H681Q694 86 694 76Q694 64 679 56H526Q510 56 480 56T434 55Q350 55 289 71T172 141Q84 223 84 346ZM104 -131T104 -118T118 -98H679Q694 -106 694 -118T679 -138H118Q104 -131 104 -118Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-4F\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"1079\" y=\"-213\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2286\" x=\"1495\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-4F\" x=\"2551\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> such that every orbit that begins inside <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.828ex\" height=\"2.384ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.505ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -809.3 1217.4 1026.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">O_1</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMATHI-4F\" d=\"M740 435Q740 320 676 213T511 42T304 -22Q207 -22 138 35T51 201Q50 209 50 244Q50 346 98 438T227 601Q351 704 476 704Q514 704 524 703Q621 689 680 617T740 435ZM637 476Q637 565 591 615T476 665Q396 665 322 605Q242 542 200 428T157 216Q157 126 200 73T314 19Q404 19 485 98T608 313Q637 408 637 476Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMATHI-4F\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"1079\" y=\"-213\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> at\nsome time <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"5.832ex\" height=\"2.259ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.63ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -701.7 2511 972.7\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">t = t_0</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMATHI-74\" d=\"M26 385Q19 392 19 395Q19 399 22 411T27 425Q29 430 36 430T87 431H140L159 511Q162 522 166 540T173 566T179 586T187 603T197 615T211 624T229 626Q247 625 254 615T261 596Q261 589 252 549T232 470L222 433Q222 431 272 431H323Q330 424 330 420