        "html": "<div class=\"step\" contentid=\"15932\" id=\"step-655321\" stepid=\"655321\" steptype=\"tutorial\" style=\"display: block\">\n<div class=\"stepHeader\">\n<div class=\"stepName\">\n<a class=\"stepAnchor\" id=\"stepAnchor-655321\" name=\"step-5\">Stability, Asymptotic Stability, and Instability</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"655321\">?</div>\n</div>\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>So far, we have learned how to find equilibrium points of a system\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.884ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.755ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -916.9 6403 1241.8\" width=\"14.872ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n\\mathbf{x}'(t) = \\mathbf{f}(x,y).\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M227 0Q212 3 121 3Q40 3 28 0H21V62H117L245 213L109 382H26V444H34Q49 441 143 441Q247 441 265 444H274V382H246L281 339Q315 2